From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ed <address-in-upstream-commit@localhost>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 18:08:44 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] drm/sysfb: simpledrm: eDP connector for an Apple built-in
 panel

Without DCP, the J714c panel is a simpledrm framebuffer whose connector
is Unknown-1. Omarchy treats every connector that is not eDP, LVDS or
DSI as an external monitor, so closing the lid kept the session in
clamshell mode instead of locking it.

A framebuffer node with apple,internal-panel now gets an eDP connector;
the J714c framebuffer node carries it. Tested on J714c: the panel is
card0-eDP-1, omarchy-hw-external-monitors reports none, and closing the
lid locks the Omarchy session.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
(cherry picked from commit 9dee12b1266c4d4f29eda19a67b964fb25ed844a)
Signed-off-by: Joshua Warren <816217+joshuaswarren@users.noreply.github.com>
(cherry picked from commit 1006491abe42bbbdecc4491e68815bfe77093202)
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t6050-j714c.dts | 1 +
 drivers/gpu/drm/sysfb/simpledrm.c         | 4 +++-
 2 files changed, 4 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t6050-j714c.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t6050-j714c.dts
index cf1d62c69..362609337 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t6050-j714c.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t6050-j714c.dts
@@ -39,6 +39,7 @@ framebuffer0: framebuffer@0 {
 			reg = <0 0 0 0>; /* To be filled by the loader */
 			/* Format properties will be added by the loader */
 			status = "disabled";
+			apple,internal-panel; /* simpledrm reports it as eDP */
 		};
 	};
 };
diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/sysfb/simpledrm.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/sysfb/simpledrm.c
index 404758261..5a821ba86 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/sysfb/simpledrm.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/sysfb/simpledrm.c
@@ -864,8 +864,10 @@ static struct simpledrm_device *simpledrm_device_create(struct drm_driver *drv,
 	/* Connector */
 
 	connector = &sdev->connector;
+	/* A built-in laptop panel the loader hands over (Apple, before DCP). */
 	ret = drm_connector_init(dev, connector, &simpledrm_connector_funcs,
-				 DRM_MODE_CONNECTOR_Unknown);
+				 of_property_read_bool(dev->dev->of_node, "apple,internal-panel") ?
+				 DRM_MODE_CONNECTOR_eDP : DRM_MODE_CONNECTOR_Unknown);
 	if (ret)
 		return ERR_PTR(ret);
 	drm_connector_helper_add(connector, &simpledrm_connector_helper_funcs);
